    "description": "Ipca Laboratories Ventures Solutions has an exciting opening for a Consultant Physician at our Visakhapatnam office. Join a company that values innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.\n\nAbout Ipca Laboratories Ventures Solutions:\nIpca Laboratories Ventures Solutions is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Adhere to NABH/JCI accreditation standards\n• Diagnose and treat medical conditions following established protocols\n• Educate patients and families on health management and disease prevention\n• Maintain accurate clinical documentation in electronic health records\n• Provide high-quality patient care and maintain patient records\n• Respond to medical emergencies and provide immediate care\n• Collaborate with pharmaceutical representatives and medical suppliers\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Master's degree preferred\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Medical Terminology\n• Proficiency in Telemedicine\n• Proficiency in Pharmacovigilance\n• Proficiency in ICU Management\n• Proficiency in ICD-10\n• Proficiency in Diagnostic Skills\n• Proficiency in Clinical Documentation\n• Proficiency in Medical Coding\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Ipca Laboratories Ventures Solutions!",
